(7693625, 1261116, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is so interesting, ethereal, clever and happily startling.  It''s a mysterious formation of pinnacles poking just above the mist.  And that misty central gray is exquisitely delicate, as befits the magical impulse that raised the upthrust tines. <br/>Fine.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'This is so interesting, ethereal, clever and happily startling.  It''s a mysterious formation of pinnacles poking just above the mist.  And that misty central gray is exquisitely delicate, as befits the magical impulse that raised the upthrust tines. Fine.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-05-06 23:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693626, 1261044, 173844, '<td valign="top">If there can be a tempest in a teapot, then why not a maelstrom in a kitchen?  Mysterious and unfathomable, though I''m venturing a guess -- the sink?  This is the art I hoped and imagined would be found by our creators.</td>', 'If there can be a tempest in a teapot, then why not a maelstrom in a kitchen?  Mysterious and unfathomable, though I''m venturing a guess -- the sink?  This is the art I hoped and imagined would be found by our creators.', '2021-05-06 23:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7693629, 1261077, 173844, '<td valign="top">Strikingly elegant and gracefully attained.  The colors are wonderful, saturated and pastel in charming harmony.  The wonderful texture clinches the deal, so artfully devised.  My favorite utensil sculpture of all time.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Strikingly elegant and gracefully attained.  The colors are wonderful, saturated and pastel in charming harmony.  The wonderful texture clinches the deal, so artfully devised.  My favorite utensil sculpture of all time.Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2021-05-06 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
